  "description": "Demolition of existing garages and construction of 9 new residential dwellings (Use Class C3) with associated amenity space, cycle parking, refuse stores, hard and soft landscaping, play space, improvements to access and public realm, and other associated works.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to commencement (excluding demolition) following the Stage 1 Road Safety Audit (RSA) received, a satisfactory Stage 2 RSA shall be submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The development shall thereafter proceed in accordance with the approved details.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Stage 2 (Level 2) RSA shall include.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Timing: Commissioned and completed using the near-final detailed design drawings before the design package is finalised or issued for construction tender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drawings Required: The audit requires the full, near-final set of detailed design drawings (including alignment, road markings, signing, and visibility splays).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prior to the first occupation of the development a Stage 3 (Level 3) RSA shall be undertaken, submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interest of highway safety.&lt;/p&gt;"
